IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CHUNKED-KV-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ALLOCATED-PAGES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACTIVE-PAGES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FRAG-PCT            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CHUNKED-KV-V2.
    IF ALLOCATED-PAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF ACTIVE-PAGES > ALLOCATED-PAGES
        MOVE ALLOCATED-PAGES TO ACTIVE-PAGES.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE FRAG-PCT = ((ALLOCATED-PAGES - ACTIVE-PAGES) * 100) / ALLOCATED-PAGES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 FRAG-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
